_vit_h.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/clip_vision/dino_v3_vit_h.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [triposplat_vae_decoder_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/vae/triposplat_vae_decoder_fp16.safetensors)\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 background_removal/\n│   │   └── birefnet.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── triposplat_fp16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 clip_vision/\n│   │   └── dino_v3_vit_h.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       ├── triposplat_vae_decoder_fp16.safetensors\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Model Link", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [580, 1080], "pos": [-910, 1130], "id": 93, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## TripoSplat\n\nSingle 2D image → 3D Gaussian splat. Preview, export, or drop into game / AR / VR pipelines. Best on stylized objects.\n\n- Github: [VAST-AI-Research/TripoSplat](https://github.com/VAST-AI-Research/TripoSplat)\n- Paper: [arXiv:2605.16355](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16355)\n- Model: [VAST-AI/TripoSplat](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat)\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Load image in **LoadImage**\n2. Tune **Image to Gaussian Splat (TripoSplat)** subgraph\n3. Queue — **Create Video** with an orbit preview and export an SPZ file\n4. To export a GLB file select the bypassed nodes, press **Ctrl+B** to enable, then re-run\n\n## Subgraph Settings\n\n| Setting | Effect |\n|---------|--------|\n| `remove_background` | BiRefNet removes background before generation. Off if image is already clean/transparent. |\n| `sampling_num_gaussians` (decode) | Final output count (rounded to ×32). **262144** = octree density. Higher oversamples existing points — denser, not more detail; costs more VRAM/time. |\n| `seed` | Change for different variations. |\n| Model selectors | Keep unless using custom checkpoints. |\n\n## Output Branches\n\n| Branch | Status | Output |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| **Create Video** | active | Orbit preview video |\n| **Create 3D Model (SPZ)** | active | 3D Gaussian splat (.spz) |\n| **Create 3D Model (GLB)** | bypassed | Mesh export (.glb, experimental) — select nodes → **Ctrl+B** to enable |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: TripoSplat", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [580, 1240], "pos": [-270, 1130], "id": 94, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [226], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "links": [227], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent", "links": [228], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "size": [290, 120], "pos": [1880, 890], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "clip_vision", "link": 220, "label": "clip_vision", "type": "CLIP_VISION", "localized_name": "clip_vision"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 221, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"name": "image", "link": 222, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "flags": {}, "